ities do not  want to see  a failure at hwarong which roils the  broader market  if we were to see fundamental and  painful restructuring of china huarong  or if we were allowed to see any kind of  payment failure  at a firm like warong which is  considered to be of  systemic importance which was backed by  central government institutions then  that really would change the way that  investors look at this market  [Music]  you

